#Start
@showUI dialog
@showUI commandBar visible:true
@back bg:game-a-academy-hall-fullscreen effect:fade time:0.05
@charTone rain
@char alice pos:50 time:0.3 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT CHARACTER 00 - default composition.
@char alice.body0,eye1,mouth1 pos:50 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT CHARACTER 01 - eye and mouth replacement.
@char alice.eye3,mouth3,armR3 pos:50 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT CHARACTER 02 - single arm replacement.
@char alice.eye4,mouth4,armR2,armL4 pos:50 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT CHARACTER 03 - both arms replacement.
@charTone sunset amount:1.5 time:0.2 wait!
@char alice.eye2,mouth2,armR0,armL0 pos:50 wait!
Narrator: CHECKPOINT CHARACTER 04 - final multilayer composition with sunset tone.
@choice "完成角色测试" goto:#Complete

#Complete
Narrator: CHECKPOINT CHARACTER COMPLETE
@end
